proof = "Both fixtures retain pinned manifest hashes, byte-exact codec round trips, signature verification, snapshot load, registration bootstrap and refusal assertions. The audit additionally replays each committed request through the production parser and builder, compares the signed manifest, snapshot payload and roots, public key, registration request and deployment descriptor byte for byte, verifies initialized state, and refuses corrupted signatures and both corrupted roots."
